    "3fec68ca-0c8a-4614-8800-6d9223548dfc": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--17365333049621__3fec68ca-0c8a-4614-8800-6d9223548dfc-16747870468e373531-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "OSC Router",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "template--17365333049621__3fec68ca-0c8a-4614-8800-6d9223548dfc-16747870468e373531-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>The Giggle Tech OSC Router makes controlling your hardware a breeze.</p><p>Quick setup for seamless hardware control. No fuss, just fun!</p><p>Get the router <a href=\"https://github.com/giggletech/GiggleTech_OSC_Router/releases\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://github.com/giggletech/GiggleTech_OSC_Router/releases\">[Here</a>]</p>",
